From 9583cf0c80a4467ae013621ca592e55c3fd979a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Navi48-MacOS contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] radv: Darwin scanout API on the N48N connection, ABI 1.1
 (Navi48 S2b)

Header refreshed from the kext (0.0.603, ABI 1 minor 1; sha256 8f1399d7...).
Hello asks for the minor (flags bit 8) and falls back to plain on a v1.0
kernel. Marshals selectors 9..14 (ScanoutQuery/Acquire/Register/Present/
Status/Release) and exports radv_darwin_scanout_* from libvulkan_radeon
(VkDevice/VkDeviceMemory -> BO handle) so present shares the one per-process
connection (D-S2-1). The mock models the scanout with a 60 Hz frame counter.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
